{"product":{"id":8631075373310,"title":"SiS GO Isotonic Energy Gels","body_html":"\u003cdiv id=\"section1\" class=\"faq accordion-open\"\u003e\n\u003ch2 class=\"text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.375rem] font-bold\"\u003eScience In Sport GO Isotonic Energy Gel\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eFast-acting \u003cstrong\u003eenergy gels\u003c\/strong\u003e built for endurance athletes — runners, cyclists, triathletes, swimmers, and team-sport players — who need a quick, easily digestible carbohydrate hit during exercise without the bloat or stomach distress that comes with most syrupy, non-isotonic competitor gels. Ideal for race day, long training sessions, and any effort sustained beyond an hour where carb depletion starts to impact pace.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eWhat separates this from the rest of the gel category comes down to the genuinely isotonic formulation — and the credentials behind it. The GO Energy Isotonic Gel was the world's first true isotonic energy gel and a winner of the Queen's Award for Enterprise. Each 60ml sachet delivers 22g of fast-release carbohydrate at the same osmotic concentration as your body's fluids, which means it can be absorbed and converted to energy without first needing to be diluted with water in the stomach. That's the practical edge: most non-isotonic gels demand a chase of 100–200ml of water with every serving to avoid stomach distress, which isn't always realistic mid-race or mid-pool. The light, compact packaging fits in jersey pockets, race belts, swim deck bags, and trisuit pouches — replacing the bulk of sports bottles when you need to travel light.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eScience In Sport is a UK-based brand publicly listed on the London Stock Exchange (AIM: SIS) and manufactured to \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/www.who.int\/health-topics\/good-manufacturing-practices\"\u003eGMP\u003c\/a\u003e standards. The GO Isotonic Energy Gel is \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"https:\/\/sport.wetestyoutrust.com\/\"\u003eInformed-Sport\u003c\/a\u003e registered with batch-level testing for WADA-banned substances, making it a credible choice for tested-pool athletes. The brand is the official supplier to multiple WorldTour cycling teams, Olympic federations, and Premier League clubs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e22g of fast-release carbohydrate per gel\u003c\/strong\u003e in a genuinely isotonic format — no water chase needed\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThe world's first isotonic energy gel\u003c\/strong\u003e and Queen's Award for Enterprise winner — the original benchmark in the category\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExcellent as energy gels for swimmers\u003c\/strong\u003e during pool deck breaks and as \u003cstrong\u003eenergy gels for cycling\u003c\/strong\u003e in jersey pockets — practical packaging for any sport\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVegan, vegetarian, gluten-free, lactose-free, nut-free, soya-free\u003c\/strong\u003e — the most allergen-friendly choice among the \u003cstrong\u003ebest energy gels for endurance athletes\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eInformed-Sport registered\u003c\/strong\u003e — credible for tested-pool athletes and used by professional cycling teams\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePair it with electrolyte powder or carb snacks from our \u003ca class=\"underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current\/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current\" href=\"\/collections\/energy-hydration\"\u003eenergy and hydration range\u003c\/a\u003e to hit the 60–90g carb-per-hour target on long sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"SCIENCE IN SPORT","product_type":"ENERGY GELS","created_at":"2024-08-22T19:29:10+05:30","handle":"sis-go-isotonic-energy-gel","updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:25:50+05:30","published_at":"2025-04-03T00:00:42+05:30","template_suffix":"science-in-sport","published_scope":"global","tags":"ENERGY GEL, INFORMED SPORTS, RECOVERY","variants":[{"id":46384192782590,"product_id":8631075373310,"title":"1 Gel x 60ml \/ Apple","price":"899.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"1 Gel x 60ml","option2":"Apple","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-03-12T12:23:09+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-18T01:25:50+05:30","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":47411087311102,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"LKR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":45878370238718,"product_id":8631075373310,"title":"1 Gel x 60ml \/ Cherry","price":"899.00","sku":null,"position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"1 Gel x 60ml","option2":"Cherry","option3":null,"created_at":"2024-10-12T18:05:59+05:30","updated_at":